{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1932,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal-of-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:basis-realizing-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","line":3113,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[Hypersurface Volume Form: the Necessity Half]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if}\n\n\\uses{prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth, def:unit-normal-of-orientation, prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced, def:induced-orientation, lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos, lem:basis-realizing-orientation, def:smooth-unit-normal-field, def:smooth-orientation, def:interior-multiplication}\n\n\n\n\nIf $n\\ge1$ and the immersed hypersurface has a smooth orientation, it has a smooth global unit normal $N$ and $dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth,prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced,lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos,lem:basis-realizing-orientation}\n\\sketch Take the smooth normal determined by the given orientation. Its induced orientation is the original one by the one-basis positivity criterion, so Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced} gives (2.17).\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Hypersurface Volume Form: the Necessity Half] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d766f6c756d652d666f726d2d6f6e6c792d6966\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\">↗ prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation\">↗ def:unit-normal-of-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-induced\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aoriented-unit-normal-iff-pos\">↗ lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Abasis-realizing-orientation\">↗ lem:basis-realizing-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-unit-normal-field\">↗ def:smooth-unit-normal-field</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-orientation\">↗ def:smooth-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n\\ge 1$\">$n\\ge 1$</span> and the immersed hypersurface has a smooth orientation, it has a smooth global unit normal <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N$\">$N$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M$\">$dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M$</span>.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\">↗ prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-induced\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aoriented-unit-normal-iff-pos\">↗ lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Abasis-realizing-orientation\">↗ lem:basis-realizing-orientation</a> \\sketch Take the smooth normal determined by the given orientation. Its induced orientation is the original one by the one-basis positivity criterion, so Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-induced\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d766f6c756d652d666f726d2d696e6475636564\">8</a> gives (2.17). </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","title":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","label":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal-of-orientation","title":"def:unit-normal-of-orientation","label":"def:unit-normal-of-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos","title":"lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos","label":"lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:basis-realizing-orientation","title":"lem:basis-realizing-orientation","label":"lem:basis-realizing-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field","title":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field","label":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","label":"def:smooth-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prob:hypersurface-volume-form","title":"prob:hypersurface-volume-form","label":"prob:hypersurface-volume-form"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[Hypersurface Volume Form: the Necessity Half]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if}\n\n\\uses{prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth, def:unit-normal-of-orientation, prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced, def:induced-orientation, lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos, lem:basis-realizing-orientation, def:smooth-unit-normal-field, def:smooth-orientation, def:interior-multiplication}\n\n\n\n\nIf $n\\ge1$ and the immersed hypersurface has a smooth orientation, it has a smooth global unit normal $N$ and $dV_g=(N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth,prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced,lem:oriented-unit-normal-iff-pos,lem:basis-realizing-orientation}\n\\sketch Take the smooth normal determined by the given orientation. Its induced orientation is the original one by the one-basis positivity criterion, so Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced} gives (2.17).\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapte